    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_callee_saved_info" kindref="compound">CalleeSavedInfo</ref> class tracks the information need to locate where a callee saved register is in the current frame. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Callee saved reg can also be saved to a different register rather than on the stack by setting DstReg instead of FrameIdx. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
